  "content": "<h1 align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/贊助我-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Patreon 贊助我\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/加入我們的 Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/贊助我-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 贊助我\">\n  </a>\n</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n# Tree Miner（伐木助手）\n\n一個 Minecraft 資料包，當你蹲下破壞原木時，能自動砍倒整棵樹。\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wEhW4ceB/images/32390c308957b4fd88e0a12083649cd56b1ce576.gif\" alt=\"Tree Miner 預覽\">\n</p>\n\n## 注意事項\n\n- 伐木功能僅在蹲下（潛行）時觸發\n- 若只想破壞一個方塊，請正常破壞原木（不蹲下）\n- 樹葉會正常掉落其物品（樹苗、樹枝），就像手動破壞一樣\n- 使用間隔有短暫冷卻時間，以防止效能問題",
